{
	"$description": "AUTHORED — the DevPULSE / ColdLight palette registry. Migrated 1:1 from the foundry palette sources (source/palettes/*.palette.ts). Every palette carries its anchor { hue, chroma } and its curves — `curve` (lightness, per build/generate-scales.mjs LIGHTNESS) and `chromaCurve` (chroma multiplier, per CHROMA). This is the real DevPULSE color system, not a flat approximation. Read by build/generate-scales.mjs → 13-step OKLCH ladders; not a DTCG file, sits outside tokens/src/.",

	"$laws": [
		"L2 — ONE theme. DevPULSE IS ColdLight. Every hue is a primary available inside the single theme as --color-{id}-{step}. No data-brand, no scope, no picker.",
		"L4 — a large pool. Adding a palette costs one object and yields a 13-step ladder + Tailwind utilities + TS types.",
		"Never pure black as a generated step — the ladder floors at L=0.10. The void base anchor (L=0.08) and absolute black are authored exceptions."
	],

	"groups": {
		"brand": {
